    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the arcades of the early 1980s. Scorpion Hero is a frenetic side-scrolling shooter with pixel-glow graphics, full of action and explosions in the style of the first games released in the arcades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a road warrior named Moondog-g, who created the powerful vehicle called Scorpion Hero. Pate-br, the most important person in the galaxy, has hired you to clear the trade routes of each planet of space pirates or he'll raise the tariffs on products to 100%. However, each planet is full of dangers that you also have to watch out for and that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10 frantic levels with progressively increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Be proud of getting to the top 1, as there is only one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Keep an eye on your vehicle's headlights to protect yourself from the dangers in your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy incoming hazards with your powerful frontal plasma pincer cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Eliminate airborne enemies with your scorpion-tail missile turret.</p>",
